        "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title>\n                <jats:sec>\n                  <jats:title>Motivation</jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>Antimicrobial peptides (AMPs) are innate immune components that have aroused a great deal of interest among drug developers recently, as they may become a substitution for antibiotics. However, AMPs discovery through traditional wet-lab research is expensive and inefficient. Thus, we developed AI4AMP, a user-friendly web-server that provides an accurate prediction of the antimicrobial activity of a given protein sequence, to accelerate the process of AMP discovery.</jats:p>\n                </jats:sec>\n                <jats:sec>\n                  <jats:title>Results</jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>Our results show that our prediction model is superior to the existing AMP predictors.</jats:p>\n                </jats:sec>\n                <jats:sec>\n                  <jats:title>Availability</jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>\n                    AI4AMP is freely accessible at\n                    <jats:ext-link xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" ext-link-type=\"uri\" xlink:href=\"http://symbiosis.iis.sinica.edu.tw/PC_6/\">http://symbiosis.iis.sinica.edu.tw/PC_6/</jats:ext-link>\n                  </jats:p>\n                </jats:sec>\n                <jats:sec>\n                  <jats:title>Contact</jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>\n                    <jats:email>cylin@iis.sinica.edu.tw</jats:email>\n                  </jats:p>\n                </jats:sec>",
